"""Failure modes of the Voron 0.2 (the reasoning layer of the FMEA graph).

Each mode: id, part (one of the 31 parts), name, prior (how common, 1 = normal), symptoms {symptom id: P(seen | this mode)},
check (how the technician confirms it), source (document or reason).
P values: 0.9 = almost always seen, 0.7 = usually, 0.5 = often, 0.3 = sometimes.
Sources: BOM (voron0.2_bom.csv), CFG (bigtreetech-skr-pico-v1.0.cfg), MAN (assembly manual), DOC (docs.vorondesign.com),
KLP (Klipper documentation: config reference, common errors), PHY (physical reasoning, stated).
"""
